<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Tabuk Cement Co Q1 pre-tax profit drops.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Tabuk Cement Co Q1 pre-tax profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	    4.2   vs    8.1</p>
<p> Operating income	  5.9   vs    9.8</p>
<p> Expenses		    1.7   vs    1.8</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity  780.6   vs  759.8</p>
<p> Assets		  1,082.9   vs  844.0</p>
<p>Full Name - Tabuk Cement Company.</p>
<p>Note - Mitsubishi Heavy Industries and Ube Industries Ltd are building a 1.1 million cement plant for the Saudi company.</p>
</text>
